    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6631" root="جوب" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجُوبُ</span></b>  [pass. part. n. of 1, q. v.:] Anything
<i>cut in the middle,</i> or <i>of which the middle is cut
out;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُجَوَّبٌ</span></b> ; (T, TA;) and the latter,
anything <i>hollowed out in the middle.</i> (TA.)

